      ],
      "updated": 1779133259256,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Three Layers",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The Three Layers",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SQji4brFrQ0wSVMUtTMNT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -150.32539351640642,
      "y": 1615.1816603100417,
      "width": 742.4197387695312,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2104829342,
      "version": 374,
      "versionNonce": 275018910,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779133283220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Layer 1 — Memory\n\n    When you correct Hermes or it learns something\nstable about you or your setup, it writes it to\npersistent memory immediately. It gets injected into\nevery future session automatically.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Layer 1 — Memory\n\n    When you correct Hermes or it learns something stable about you or your setup, it writes it to persistent memory immediately. It gets injected into every future session automatically.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b0d91vQtiNmXQ1tIjXMeP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -150.32539403905162,
      "y": 1889.7530006401482,
      "width": 742.4197387695312,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 258919070,
      "version": 503,
      "versionNonce": 1824127710,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779133292167,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Layer 2 — Skills\n\n    When Hermes solves a problem it hasn't seen\nbefore, it writes down exactly how it did it. Next\ntime that situation comes up, it loads the playbook\ninstead of starting from scratch. You can read it,\nedit it, or create your own.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Layer 2 — Skills\n\n    When Hermes solves a problem it hasn't seen before, it writes down exactly how it did it. Next time that situation comes up, it loads the playbook instead of starting from scratch. You can read it, edit it, or create your own.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HXRi17B19NhHBjswBa6cE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -158.59556165145258,
      "y": 2199.3243416465593,
      "width": 742.4197387695312,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 123732802,
      "version": 467,
      "versionNonce": 1345905758,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "CaRETik_2M8BIfhTd3TPC",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1779133452764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Layer 3 — Cron Jobs\n\n    Tasks that run on a schedule without you\ntouching anything. You describe the job once, set the\ntime, and it fires automatically. Every morning at 8am.\nEvery 5 minutes. Every time a new video drops. This\nis your Hermes Agent's trigger.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Layer 3 — Cron Jobs\n\n    Tasks that run on a schedule without you touching anything. You describe the job once, set the time, and it fires automatically. Every morning at 8am. Every 5 minutes. Every time a new video drops. This is your Hermes Agent's trigger.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
